{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792483799066,"sessionID":"ses_ea7a42d06ffertwkCvnfJRvReD","part":{"partID":"prt_1585c2f20001468s0Hy5MVTZFC","sessionID":"ses_ea7a42d06ffertwkCvnfJRvReD","messageID":"msg_1585c172e001rmEBvbw7k6Kzqj","type":"tool","id":"call_00_cdt55d9tq7padxnsnu7jffhy","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_3a658ba085e8417ea6faad5cb0cdd493/attempt-2/blueprint-spec-review-0-ad1379367f3e742a-phase_acceptance/source/RESEARCH.md"},"output":"Read file /Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_3a658ba085e8417ea6faad5cb0cdd493/attempt-2/blueprint-spec-review-0-ad1379367f3e742a-phase_acceptance/source/RESEARCH.md, lines 1-69\n1: {\n2:   \"gaps\": [\n3:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n4:     \"Behavior of Ripple TS reactivity primitives (track/effect/bindGroup/bindValue) at this pinned version was not\n5: validated.\",\n6:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n7:     \"Host excluded unsupported evidence inf-no-tests: Depends on a quarantined, unlocated observation\",\n8:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n9:     \"Host excluded unsupported evidence obs-no-test-files: observation cites an unknown source path: source/src\",\n10:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n11:     \"No automated tests exist in the manifest, so none of the described behaviors are test-confirmed.\",\n12:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n13:     \"Runtime behavior was not observed; all claims are static reading of source files.\",\n14:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n15:     \"The full commit tree was inferred from the supplied source_manifest and the on-disk source/ directory; files\n16: outside it were not inspected.\",\n17:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n18:     \"The paired Research Notes referenced by leaf.md were not supplied, so product-level evidence beyond the pinned\n19: repository is unavailable.\",\n20:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n21:     \"Whether Dexie/IndexedDB persistence behaves correctly in real browsers at this commit is unverified.\",\n22:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n23:     \"Whether the third-party metadata/favicon endpoints (api.microlink.io, images.weserv.nl, Google s2 favicons) are\n24: reachable, rate-limited, or CORS-permitted at runtime is unverified.\"\n25:   ],\n26:   \"summary\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_05babdea64ba9858 [code_observation]: New records are built with id\n27: `bm-${crypto.randomUUID()}`, hostname from getHostname(url), and defaults visitCount=0, visitedAt=null, isPinned=false,\n28: isArchived=false, createdAt=Date.now(); edits preserve the previous id, isPinned, isArchived, visitCount, createdAt, and\n29: visitedAt.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_06c81a165e03c96a [code_observation]: Pin/Unpin and Edit actions are rendered only when the\n30: item is not archived, and Edit loads the item's url/title/description/tags/favicon into the\n31: dialog.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_1596da4a90687ca5 [code_observation]: The Valibot BookmarkFormSchema requires a non-empty URL\n32: matching /^https?:\\\\/\\\\/(?:[\\\\w-]+\\\\.)+[a-zA-Z]{2,}(?:\\\\/\\\\S*)?$/ and v.url, a non-empty title up to 100 chars, a non-\n33: empty description up to 280 chars, and 1-5 tags each up to 30 chars.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_3168bcd465b6a043 [inference]:\n34: The scenario's user-controlled 'category' (归类) is realized only as up to five free-text tags on each record; there are\n35: no creatable, renameable, or nestable collections, and no separate move operation beyond editing\n36: tags.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_35e41aab676021eb [code_observation]: saveBookmark sets the record in the in-memory map then\n37: awaits db.bookmarks.put(bm); deleteBookmark removes from the map then awaits\n38: db.bookmarks.delete(id).\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_4c56ef30a1785be1 [code_observation]: A Delete action is rendered only for\n39: archived items; it calls deleteBookmark and shows an error-type toast with an Undo action that calls saveBookmark(item)\n40: to restore the record.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_6bbd7a588896fe31 [inference]: The scenario step of letting unclassified links\n41: land in a default category is not supported, because the form schema rejects saves with zero\n42: tags.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_7150b0ac7a5678db [code_observation]: A Copy URL action writes item.url to the clipboard and\n43: shows a success toast.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_7d47d725a2e9b759 [inference]: Metadata and favicon enrichment is best-effort\n44: and dependent on third-party HTTP services; failures degrade silently to console errors while the bookmark still saves\n45: with whatever fields the user entered or omitted defaults for.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_86ed2327f33a3ca8 [code_observation]:\n46: An effect on component creation calls db.bookmarks.toArray() and inserts each returned bookmark into an in-memory\n47: RippleMap keyed by bookmark id.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_8e11efc61a4650ba [code_observation]: On submit, if no favicon exists\n48: and a hostname is derivable, the code fetches a Google s2 favicon proxied through images.weserv.nl inside a try/catch\n49: that only logs failure.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_922f1dbc84912d99 [inference]: Persistence is local to one browser\n50: profile/device via IndexedDB with no sync layer, so the scenario's cross-session growth holds only on the same browser,\n51: and the leaf's multi-device context is unmet.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_93ef917a193a45ab [inference]: Deletion is limited to\n52: archived records and recovery is only the transient Undo action on the toast; there is no trash view, and non-archived\n53: records cannot be deleted at all through the UI.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_93ff254508846f11 [code_observation]: The Visit\n54: action builds an updated bookmark with visitedAt=Date.now() and visitCount+1, calls saveBookmark(updated), then opens\n55: the URL with window.open(item.url, '_blank', 'noopener,noreferrer').\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_9ab6b0e51811a16d\n56: [code_observation]: The displayed list filters by isArchived matching the active tab, requires every selected tag to be\n57: present in bookmark.tags, matches search only against bookmark.title.toLowerCase(), and sorts pinned-first then by the\n58: chosen sort mode with createdAt descending as fallback.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_b1ca64cf2ad02998 [code_observation]: The\n59: Archive/Unarchive action toggles isArchived and, when archiving, forces isPinned=false before\n60: saving.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_c4ad7e52e5713628 [code_observation]: Tag counts are derived by iterating all in-memory\n61: bookmarks and counting each tag occurrence, then sorted alphabetically for the\n62: sidebar.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_e62ae7e0a2c68ba1 [inference]: Retrieval by keyword covers only bookmark titles, not URLs,\n63: descriptions, or tag names, so the scenario's 'find by a remembered word' workflow is partially\n64: supported.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_e7dd8d32c05c39f9 [inference]: The app supports the scenario's save-now/find-later loop: a\n65: deliberate add dialog writes a URL-anchored record into durable IndexedDB, and the record can later be browsed, tag-\n66: filtered, title-searched, and opened back to the live URL.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_ec303a2fd1afa287 [code_observation]:\n67: fetchMeta calls https://api.microlink.io/?url=... and, on success with result.data, sets title/description and fetches\n68: the logo through https://images.weserv.nl/; errors are only console.error'd and the finally block resets loading.\"\n69: }","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file /Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_3a658ba085e8417ea6faad5cb0cdd493/attempt-2/blueprint-spec-review-0-ad1379367f3e742a-phase_acceptance/source/RESEARCH.md, lines 1-69\n1: {\n2:   \"gaps\": [\n3:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n4:     \"Behavior of Ripple TS reactivity primitives (track/effect/bindGroup/bindValue) at this pinned version was not\n5: validated.\",\n6:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n7:     \"Host excluded unsupported evidence inf-no-tests: Depends on a quarantined, unlocated observation\",\n8:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n9:     \"Host excluded unsupported evidence obs-no-test-files: observation cites an unknown source path: source/src\",\n10:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n11:     \"No automated tests exist in the manifest, so none of the described behaviors are test-confirmed.\",\n12:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n13:     \"Runtime behavior was not observed; all claims are static reading of source files.\",\n14:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n15:     \"The full commit tree was inferred from the supplied source_manifest and the on-disk source/ directory; files\n16: outside it were not inspected.\",\n17:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n18:     \"The paired Research Notes referenced by leaf.md were not supplied, so product-level evidence beyond the pinned\n19: repository is unavailable.\",\n20:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n21:     \"Whether Dexie/IndexedDB persistence behaves correctly in real browsers at this commit is unverified.\",\n22:     \"Unverified case limitation (case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414 r1); not accepted evidence:\",\n23:     \"Whether the third-party metadata/favicon endpoints (api.microlink.io, images.weserv.nl, Google s2 favicons) are\n24: reachable, rate-limited, or CORS-permitted at runtime is unverified.\"\n25:   ],\n26:   \"summary\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_05babdea64ba9858 [code_observation]: New records are built with id\n27: `bm-${crypto.randomUUID()}`, hostname from getHostname(url), and defaults visitCount=0, visitedAt=null, isPinned=false,\n28: isArchived=false, createdAt=Date.now(); edits preserve the previous id, isPinned, isArchived, visitCount, createdAt, and\n29: visitedAt.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_06c81a165e03c96a [code_observation]: Pin/Unpin and Edit actions are rendered only when the\n30: item is not archived, and Edit loads the item's url/title/description/tags/favicon into the\n31: dialog.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_1596da4a90687ca5 [code_observation]: The Valibot BookmarkFormSchema requires a non-empty URL\n32: matching /^https?:\\\\/\\\\/(?:[\\\\w-]+\\\\.)+[a-zA-Z]{2,}(?:\\\\/\\\\S*)?$/ and v.url, a non-empty title up to 100 chars, a non-\n33: empty description up to 280 chars, and 1-5 tags each up to 30 chars.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_3168bcd465b6a043 [inference]:\n34: The scenario's user-controlled 'category' (归类) is realized only as up to five free-text tags on each record; there are\n35: no creatable, renameable, or nestable collections, and no separate move operation beyond editing\n36: tags.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_35e41aab676021eb [code_observation]: saveBookmark sets the record in the in-memory map then\n37: awaits db.bookmarks.put(bm); deleteBookmark removes from the map then awaits\n38: db.bookmarks.delete(id).\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_4c56ef30a1785be1 [code_observation]: A Delete action is rendered only for\n39: archived items; it calls deleteBookmark and shows an error-type toast with an Undo action that calls saveBookmark(item)\n40: to restore the record.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_6bbd7a588896fe31 [inference]: The scenario step of letting unclassified links\n41: land in a default category is not supported, because the form schema rejects saves with zero\n42: tags.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_7150b0ac7a5678db [code_observation]: A Copy URL action writes item.url to the clipboard and\n43: shows a success toast.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_7d47d725a2e9b759 [inference]: Metadata and favicon enrichment is best-effort\n44: and dependent on third-party HTTP services; failures degrade silently to console errors while the bookmark still saves\n45: with whatever fields the user entered or omitted defaults for.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_86ed2327f33a3ca8 [code_observation]:\n46: An effect on component creation calls db.bookmarks.toArray() and inserts each returned bookmark into an in-memory\n47: RippleMap keyed by bookmark id.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_8e11efc61a4650ba [code_observation]: On submit, if no favicon exists\n48: and a hostname is derivable, the code fetches a Google s2 favicon proxied through images.weserv.nl inside a try/catch\n49: that only logs failure.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_922f1dbc84912d99 [inference]: Persistence is local to one browser\n50: profile/device via IndexedDB with no sync layer, so the scenario's cross-session growth holds only on the same browser,\n51: and the leaf's multi-device context is unmet.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_93ef917a193a45ab [inference]: Deletion is limited to\n52: archived records and recovery is only the transient Undo action on the toast; there is no trash view, and non-archived\n53: records cannot be deleted at all through the UI.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_93ff254508846f11 [code_observation]: The Visit\n54: action builds an updated bookmark with visitedAt=Date.now() and visitCount+1, calls saveBookmark(updated), then opens\n55: the URL with window.open(item.url, '_blank', 'noopener,noreferrer').\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_9ab6b0e51811a16d\n56: [code_observation]: The displayed list filters by isArchived matching the active tab, requires every selected tag to be\n57: present in bookmark.tags, matches search only against bookmark.title.toLowerCase(), and sorts pinned-first then by the\n58: chosen sort mode with createdAt descending as fallback.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_b1ca64cf2ad02998 [code_observation]: The\n59: Archive/Unarchive action toggles isArchived and, when archiving, forces isPinned=false before\n60: saving.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_c4ad7e52e5713628 [code_observation]: Tag counts are derived by iterating all in-memory\n61: bookmarks and counting each tag occurrence, then sorted alphabetically for the\n62: sidebar.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_e62ae7e0a2c68ba1 [inference]: Retrieval by keyword covers only bookmark titles, not URLs,\n63: descriptions, or tag names, so the scenario's 'find by a remembered word' workflow is partially\n64: supported.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_e7dd8d32c05c39f9 [inference]: The app supports the scenario's save-now/find-later loop: a\n65: deliberate add dialog writes a URL-anchored record into durable IndexedDB, and the record can later be browsed, tag-\n66: filtered, title-searched, and opened back to the live URL.\\n\\nev_ba200adf6e2c_ec303a2fd1afa287 [code_observation]:\n67: fetchMeta calls https://api.microlink.io/?url=... and, on success with result.data, sets title/description and fetches\n68: the logo through https://images.weserv.nl/; errors are only console.error'd and the finally block resets loading.\"\n69: }"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"/Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_3a658ba085e8417ea6faad5cb0cdd493/attempt-2/blueprint-spec-review-0-ad1379367f3e742a-phase_acceptance/source/RESEARCH.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1792483798816,"end":1792483799066}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792483799068,"sessionID":"ses_ea7a42d06ffertwkCvnfJRvReD","part":{"partID":"prt_1585c2fc4001I9e4fNCoehNPlf","sessionID":"ses_ea7a42d06ffertwkCvnfJRvReD","messageID":"msg_1585c172e001rmEBvbw7k6Kzqj","type":"tool","id":"call_01_stz7t9p0iut879wdgo6i5dae","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_3a658ba085e8417ea6faad5cb0cdd493/attempt-2/blueprint-spec-review-0-ad1379367f3e742a-phase_acceptance/source/program-evidence/PROGRAM_EVIDENCE.json"},"output":"Read file /Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_3a658ba085e8417ea6faad5cb0cdd493/attempt-2/blueprint-spec-review-0-ad1379367f3e742a-phase_acceptance/source/program-evidence/PROGRAM_EVIDENCE.json, lines 1-288\n1: {\n2:   \"authorization_material_digest\": \"6bab6cf15f0c238fa8a7b7bc5a192caf704ef84b33055ad95543db41edcf00ae\",\n3:   \"effective_plan_digest\": \"e7b9e82beb121a4d73852e556eac0eeefd2406af2cd4a3f8fc6489eea4944f54\",\n4:   \"findings_disposition_sha256\": \"5ff02a1ad9485f2af95466719b7c1de3bb5d16b9a530233ab9d148b6e2c24401\",\n5:   \"prepared_program_revision\": {\n6:     \"entries\": [\n7:       {\n8:         \"after_sha256\": \"7f0d7d28d8336bdde3da267795e24d13e430f05e53063ee01ed5611236325d37\",\n9:         \"authorization_clause\": \"R7 §3.0 exact byte-for-byte reuse\",\n10:         \"before_sha256\": \"7f0d7d28d8336bdde3da267795e24d13e430f05e53063ee01ed5611236325d37\",\n11:         \"checkpoint_digest\": \"1ed409f518e113f0baa72ea56677557acb2b51440cf052cc009da15698efeabb\",\n12:         \"checkpoint_name\": \"blueprint-code-0-0\",\n13:         \"mode\": \"reuse\",\n14:         \"patch\": [],\n15:         \"patch_digest\": \"4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945\",\n16:         \"path\": \"acceptance/common.py\",\n17:         \"prepared_ref\": \"docs/template-factory/g1-r7-acceptance-alignment-2026-10-20/prepared-programs/acceptance/common.py\",\n18:         \"source_attempt\": 1,\n19:         \"source_job_id\": \"job_f3e32b56036b4ec7bea0c00d6a2a8dc4\"\n20:       },\n21:       {\n22:         \"after_sha256\": \"5923bdd1d15e7d98bcf2c3b91123b36d986c0c69cbc6a1a7fdab80ce4c437d6e\",\n23:         \"authorization_clause\": \"R7 §3.1 A02 and §3.3 A11 only\",\n24:         \"before_sha256\": \"8a5ce953288f2b09b9cc0256d869fc7dca2a3dcd3ff255dc5dd5dfa2fa51fb67\",\n25:         \"checkpoint_digest\": \"190c7d3c6167075f88af3e0610d50d98c1bed3e429951079345f6f5428f4d037\",\n26:         \"checkpoint_name\": \"blueprint-code-0-1\",\n27:         \"mode\": \"replace\",\n28:         \"patch\": [\n29:           {\n30:             \"new\": \"        # Independent JSON positive: not an HTML-created record read through JSON.\\n        before_json_ids = _record_ids(_fetch_bookmarks(client, recorder, 'a02-json-before-create'))\\n        json_boundary = f'https://atlas-a02-json-{token}/original?keep=1'\\n        positive = client.post_json('/api/bookmarks', {\\n            'url': json_boundary, 'title': f'A02 JSON {token}',\\n            'description': f'A02 JSON positive {token}',\\n        })\\n        recorder.expect_status(positive, 201, aid='a02-json-boundary-create-status')\\n        json_id = _record_id(_extract_record(_safe_json(positive)))\\n        recorder.check('a02-json-boundary-new-id', bool(json_id) and json_id not in before_json_ids,\\n                       f'独立 JSON POST 返回新的非空 id={json_id!r}')\\n        if json_id:\\n            saved = _get_record(client, recorder, json_id, 'a02-json-boundary')\\n            recorder.check('a02-json-boundary-readback',\\n                           _record_id(saved) == json_id and _record_url(saved) == json_boundary,\\n                           '独立 GET 读回同一 id 与精确原始 URL')\\n            listed_positive = _fetch_bookmarks(client, recorder, 'a02-json-positive')\\n            recorder.check('a02-json-boundary-listed', any(\\n                _record_id(item) == json_id and _record_url(item) == json_boundary\\n                for item in listed_positive), '列表包含同一 JSON 创建记录与原始 URL')\\n        before = _fetch_bookmarks(client, recorder, 'a02-before')\",\n31:             \"old\": \"        before = _fetch_bookmarks(client, recorder, 'a02-before')\"\n32:           },\n33:           {\n34:             \"new\": \"def _case_a11_base(args, recorder):\\n    client = common.HttpClient(args.base_url)\\n    unknown = f'不存在归类-{uuid.uuid4().hex[:10]}'\\n    try:\\n        health = client.get('/api/health')\\n        recorder.expect_status(health, 200, aid='a11-base-health-status')\\n        health_payload = _safe_json(health)\\n        recorder.check(\\n            'a11-base-health-json',\\n            isinstance(health_payload, dict) and bool(health_payload),\\n            f'/api/health 返回非空 JSON 对象，实际 {type(health_payload).__name__}',\\n        )\\n        page = client.get('/', accept='text/html')\\n        recorder.expect_status(page, 200, aid='a11-base-home-status')\\n        recorder.check(\\n            'a11-base-home-content-type',\\n            'text/html' in page.content_type.lower(),\\n            f'首页 Content-Type={page.content_type!r}',\\n        )\\n        doc = _parse_html(page.text)\\n        form = doc.save_form()\\n        recorder.check(\\n            'a11-base-entry-form',\\n            form is not None,\\n            '首页含 action=/bookmarks/new 且 method=post 的录入表单',\\n        )\\n        if form is not None:\\n            recorder.check(\\n                'a11-base-entry-action',\\n                _action_path(form.action) == '/bookmarks/new',\\n                f'录入表单 action={form.action!r}',\\n            )\\n            recorder.check(\\n                'a11-base-url-field',\\n                form.has_name('url'),\\n                '录入表单含 name=url 输入字段',\\n            )\\n        manager = next(\\n            (anchor for anchor in doc.anchors if anchor.testid == 'category-manager'),\\n            None,\\n        )\\n        manager_href = manager.href if manager is not None else None\\n        manager_path = ''\\n        if manager_href:\\n            try:\\n                manager_path = urllib.parse.urlsplit(manager_href).path.rstrip('/')\\n            except ValueError:\\n                manager_path = ''\\n        recorder.check(\\n            'a11-base-category-manager',\\n           ... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n35:             \"old\": \"def _case_a11(args, recorder):\\n    client = common.HttpClient(args.base_url)\\n    unknown = f'不存在归类-{uuid.uuid4().hex[:10]}'\\n    try:\\n        health = client.get('/api/health')\\n        recorder.expect_status(health, 200, aid='a11-health-status')\\n        health_payload = _safe_json(health)\\n        recorder.check(\\n            'a11-health-json',\\n            isinstance(health_payload, dict) and bool(health_payload),\\n            f'/api/health 返回非空 JSON 对象，实际 {type(health_payload).__name__}',\\n        )\\n        page = client.get('/', accept='text/html')\\n        recorder.expect_status(page, 200, aid='a11-home-status')\\n        recorder.check(\\n            'a11-home-content-type',\\n            'text/html' in page.content_type.lower(),\\n            f'首页 Content-Type={page.content_type!r}',\\n        )\\n        doc = _parse_html(page.text)\\n        form = doc.save_form()\\n        recorder.check(\\n            'a11-entry-form',\\n            form is not None,\\n            '首页含 action=/bookmarks/new 且 method=post 的录入表单',\\n        )\\n        if form is not None:\\n            recorder.check(\\n                'a11-entry-action',\\n                _action_path(form.action) == '/bookmarks/new',\\n                f'录入表单 action={form.action!r}',\\n            )\\n            recorder.check(\\n                'a11-url-field',\\n                form.has_name('url'),\\n                '录入表单含 name=url 输入字段',\\n            )\\n        manager = next(\\n            (