\": \"R7 §5.4 README factual correction only\",\n264:       \"checkpoint_digest\": \"98ec076f0980147323606a89081e18bd32dc85b393fd4ba7e2cf69e4a6bb8f3a\",\n265:       \"checkpoint_name\": \"blueprint-code-0-7\",\n266:       \"mode\": \"replace\",\n267:       \"patch_digest\": \"6249f00b1e87bb790c446cfb85f31c89de16fd44817cb17e9d8c968bc8faa89c\",\n268:       \"path\": \"acceptance/README.md\",\n269:       \"prepared_sha256\": \"9e73ee6233e5b991a9682bb0bcaa235783bd4c7a6d399d5be38c100face9db6e\",\n270:       \"source_attempt\": 1,\n271:       \"source_job_id\": \"job_f3e32b56036b4ec7bea0c00d6a2a8dc4\",\n272:       \"source_sha256\": \"01cf57941aeed3e0bfa431349b832429f4518addebd00528e8bc1a33ff189459\"\n273:     },\n274:     {\n275:       \"authorization_clause\": \"R7 §3.4 A11 argument binding only\",\n276:       \"checkpoint_digest\": \"e82ec3d43dfb470bb97557b8be78476497d3c73f86ea002ec63d37513c13e842\",\n277:       \"checkpoint_name\": \"blueprint-code-0-8\",\n278:       \"mode\": \"replace\",\n279:       \"patch_digest\": \"fbd74c98b88c86d974b7fe9749dc17ae5f2ac97e73fb6bbbe9ede18a1a01d3b6\",\n280:       \"path\": \"acceptance/runner.json\",\n281:       \"prepared_sha256\": \"3e71774a5bb0fb2b29cbb334983127264d5f377cc9e3a680b12f11da9268e201\",\n282:       \"source_attempt\": 1,\n283:       \"source_job_id\": \"job_f3e32b56036b4ec7bea0c00d6a2a8dc4\",\n284:       \"source_sha256\": \"f9448d370749dcca44fb2024b1b4b6d761d127edaf98a523063a590db5c69375\"\n285:     }\n286:   ],\n287:   \"schema\": \"atlas.r7-phase-review-program-evidence.v1\"\n288: }","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file /Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_3a658ba085e8417ea6faad5cb0cdd493/attempt-2/blueprint-spec-review-0-ad1379367f3e742a-phase_acceptance/source/program-evidence/PROGRAM_EVIDENCE.json, lines 1-288\n1: {\n2:   \"authorization_material_digest\": \"6bab6cf15f0c238fa8a7b7bc5a192caf704ef84b33055ad95543db41edcf00ae\",\n3:   \"effective_plan_digest\": \"e7b9e82beb121a4d73852e556eac0eeefd2406af2cd4a3f8fc6489eea4944f54\",\n4:   \"findings_disposition_sha256\": \"5ff02a1ad9485f2af95466719b7c1de3bb5d16b9a530233ab9d148b6e2c24401\",\n5:   \"prepared_program_revision\": {\n6:     \"entries\": [\n7:       {\n8:         \"after_sha256\": \"7f0d7d28d8336bdde3da267795e24d13e430f05e53063ee01ed5611236325d37\",\n9:         \"authorization_clause\": \"R7 §3.0 exact byte-for-byte reuse\",\n10:         \"before_sha256\": \"7f0d7d28d8336bdde3da267795e24d13e430f05e53063ee01ed5611236325d37\",\n11:         \"checkpoint_digest\": \"1ed409f518e113f0baa72ea56677557acb2b51440cf052cc009da15698efeabb\",\n12:         \"checkpoint_name\": \"blueprint-code-0-0\",\n13:         \"mode\": \"reuse\",\n14:         \"patch\": [],\n15:         \"patch_digest\": \"4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945\",\n16:         \"path\": \"acceptance/common.py\",\n17:         \"prepared_ref\": \"docs/template-factory/g1-r7-acceptance-alignment-2026-10-20/prepared-programs/acceptance/common.py\",\n18:         \"source_attempt\": 1,\n19:         \"source_job_id\": \"job_f3e32b56036b4ec7bea0c00d6a2a8dc4\"\n20:       },\n21:       {\n22:         \"after_sha256\": \"5923bdd1d15e7d98bcf2c3b91123b36d986c0c69cbc6a1a7fdab80ce4c437d6e\",\n23:         \"authorization_clause\": \"R7 §3.1 A02 and §3.3 A11 only\",\n24:         \"before_sha256\": \"8a5ce953288f2b09b9cc0256d869fc7dca2a3dcd3ff255dc5dd5dfa2fa51fb67\",\n25:         \"checkpoint_digest\": \"190c7d3c6167075f88af3e0610d50d98c1bed3e429951079345f6f5428f4d037\",\n26:         \"checkpoint_name\": \"blueprint-code-0-1\",\n27:         \"mode\": \"replace\",\n28:         \"patch\": [\n29:           {\n30:             \"new\": \"        # Independent JSON positive: not an HTML-created record read through JSON.\\n        before_json_ids = _record_ids(_fetch_bookmarks(client, recorder, 'a02-json-before-create'))\\n        json_boundary = f'https://atlas-a02-json-{token}/original?keep=1'\\n        positive = client.post_json('/api/bookmarks', {\\n            'url': json_boundary, 'title': f'A02 JSON {token}',\\n            'description': f'A02 JSON positive {token}',\\n        })\\n        recorder.expect_status(positive, 201, aid='a02-json-boundary-create-status')\\n        json_id = _record_id(_extract_record(_safe_json(positive)))\\n        recorder.check('a02-json-boundary-new-id', bool(json_id) and json_id not in before_json_ids,\\n                       f'独立 JSON POST 返回新的非空 id={json_id!r}')\\n        if json_id:\\n            saved = _get_record(client, recorder, json_id, 'a02-json-boundary')\\n            recorder.check('a02-json-boundary-readback',\\n                           _record_id(saved) == json_id and _record_url(saved) == json_boundary,\\n                           '独立 GET 读回同一 id 与精确原始 URL')\\n            listed_positive = _fetch_bookmarks(client, recorder, 'a02-json-positive')\\n            recorder.check('a02-json-boundary-listed', any(\\n                _record_id(item) == json_id and _record_url(item) == json_boundary\\n                for item in listed_positive), '列表包含同一 JSON 创建记录与原始 URL')\\n        before = _fetch_bookmarks(client, recorder, 'a02-before')\",\n31:             \"old\": \"        before = _fetch_bookmarks(client, recorder, 'a02-before')\"\n32:           },\n33:           {\n34:             \"new\": \"def _case_a11_base(args, recorder):\\n    client = common.HttpClient(args.base_url)\\n    unknown = f'不存在归类-{uuid.uuid4().hex[:10]}'\\n    try:\\n        health = client.get('/api/health')\\n        recorder.expect_status(health, 200, aid='a11-base-health-status')\\n        health_payload = _safe_json(health)\\n        recorder.check(\\n            'a11-base-health-json',\\n            isinstance(health_payload, dict) and bool(health_payload),\\n            f'/api/health 返回非空 JSON 对象，实际 {type(health_payload).__name__}',\\n        )\\n        page = client.get('/', accept='text/html')\\n        recorder.expect_status(page, 200, aid='a11-base-home-status')\\n        recorder.check(\\n            'a11-base-home-content-type',\\n            'text/html' in page.content_type.lower(),\\n            f'首页 Content-Type={page.content_type!r}',\\n        )\\n        doc = _parse_html(page.text)\\n        form = doc.save_form()\\n        recorder.check(\\n            'a11-base-entry-form',\\n            form is not None,\\n            '首页含 action=/bookmarks/new 且 method=post 的录入表单',\\n        )\\n        if form is not None:\\n            recorder.check(\\n                'a11-base-entry-action',\\n                _action_path(form.action) == '/bookmarks/new',\\n                f'录入表单 action={form.action!r}',\\n            )\\n            recorder.check(\\n                'a11-base-url-field',\\n                form.has_name('url'),\\n                '录入表单含 name=url 输入字段',\\n            )\\n        manager = next(\\n            (anchor for anchor in doc.anchors if anchor.testid == 'category-manager'),\\n            None,\\n        )\\n        manager_href = manager.href if manager is not None else None\\n        manager_path = ''\\n        if manager_href:\\n            try:\\n                manager_path = urllib.parse.urlsplit(manager_href).path.rstrip('/')\\n            except ValueError:\\n                manager_path = ''\\n        recorder.check(\\n            'a11-base-category-manager',\\n           ... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n35:             \"old\": \"def _case_a11(args, recorder):\\n    client = common.HttpClient(args.base_url)\\n    unknown = f'不存在归类-{uuid.uuid4().hex[:10]}'\\n    try:\\n        health = client.get('/api/health')\\n        recorder.expect_status(health, 200, aid='a11-health-status')\\n        health_payload = _safe_json(health)\\n        recorder.check(\\n            'a11-health-json',\\n            isinstance(health_payload, dict) and bool(health_payload),\\n            f'/api/health 返回非空 JSON 对象，实际 {type(health_payload).__name__}',\\n        )\\n        page = client.get('/', accept='text/html')\\n        recorder.expect_status(page, 200, aid='a11-home-status')\\n        recorder.check(\\n            'a11-home-content-type',\\n            'text/html' in page.content_type.lower(),\\n            f'首页 Content-Type={page.content_type!r}',\\n        )\\n        doc = _parse_html(page.text)\\n        form = doc.save_form()\\n        recorder.check(\\n            'a11-entry-form',\\n            form is not None,\\n            '首页含 action=/bookmarks/new 且 method=post 的录入表单',\\n        )\\n        if form is not None:\\n            recorder.check(\\n                'a11-entry-action',\\n                _action_path(form.action) == '/bookmarks/new',\\n                f'录入表单 action={form.action!r}',\\n            )\\n            recorder.check(\\n                'a11-url-field',\\n                form.has_name('url'),\\n                '录入表单含 name=url 输入字段',\\n            )\\n        manager = next(\\n            (anchor for anchor in doc.anchors if anchor.testid == 'category-manager'),\\n            None,\\n        )\\n        manager_href = manager.href if manager is not None else None\\n        manager_path = ''\\n        if manager_href:\\n            try:\\n                manager_path = urllib.parse.urlsplit(manager_href).path.rstrip('/')\\n            except ValueError:\\n                manager_path = ''\\n        recorder.check(\\n            'a11-category-manager',\\n            manager is not None and manager_path == '/ca... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n36:           },\n37:           {\n38:             \"new\": \"    try:\\n        args = common.parse_case_args(argv)\\n    except SystemExit as exc:\\n        raw_args = list(sys.argv[1:] if argv is None else argv)\\n        requested_a11 = '--case=A11' in raw_args or any(\\n            value == '--case' and index + 1 < len(raw_args) and raw_args[index + 1] == 'A11'\\n            for index, value in enumerate(raw_args))\\n        if not exc.code or not requested_a11:\\n            raise\\n        failed = common.Recorder('A11')\\n        failed.check('a11-fresh-arguments', False, 'A11 参数无效；详见 stderr，不降级或跳过')\\n        return failed.finish('A11')\\n    recorder = common.Recorder(args.case)\",\n39:             \"old\": \"    args = common.parse_case_args(argv)\\n    recorder = common.Recorder(args.case)\"\n40:           }\n41:         ],\n42:         \"patch_digest\": \"98753fcaafc6bb575e92d70cae8841919fe32f894bd0de48de4ed7e9ad8713fb\",\n43:         \"path\": \"acceptance/p0_library.py\",\n44:         \"prepared_ref\": \"docs/template-factory/g1-r7-acceptance-alignment-2026-10-20/prepared-programs/acceptance/p0_library.py\",\n45:         \"source_attempt\": 1,\n46:         \"source_job_id\": \"job_f3e32b56036b4ec7bea0c00d6a2a8dc4\"\n47:       },\n48:       {\n49:         \"after_sha256\": \"93ae82c74946811fac3b1dd213cc077cf89acc6ecfb45e64ec2830e3482b7f60\",\n50:         \"authorization_clause\": \"R7 §3.0 exact byte-for-byte reuse\",\n51:         \"before_sha256\": \"93ae82c74946811fac3b1dd213cc077cf89acc6ecfb45e64ec2830e3482b7f60\",\n52:         \"checkpoint_digest\": \"53179c085884454f4c5d1012bcfc80ced838fa0f3a336ff9434ef19d5a158814\",\n53:         \"checkpoint_name\": \"blueprint-code-0-2\",\n54:         \"mode\": \"reuse\",\n55:         \"patch\": [],\n56:         \"patch_digest\": \"4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945\",\n57:         \"path\": \"acceptance/p0_organize.py\",\n58:         \"prepared_ref\": \"docs/template-factory/g1-r7-acceptance-alignment-2026-10-20/prepared-programs/acceptance/p0_organize.py\",\n59:         \"source_attempt\": 1,\n60:         \"source_job_id\": \"job_f3e32b56036b4ec7bea0c00d6a2a8dc4\"\n61:       },\n62:       {\n63:         \"after_sha256\": \"342e38d2298cf48e22fb97d76e080ce4a67c3c10a942502c5ef205954878d667\",\n64:         \"authorization_clause\": \"R7 §3.2 A07 only\",\n65:         \"before_sha256\": \"4ba2fa6d2a6d3b306d6be5f82ef63604b836cf3d84bd0fc5efddf4d64683a6da\",\n66:         \"checkpoint_digest\": \"293c6fab073062eb832695528589a6d3df22c5c9500c16421419f21978a5621e\",\n67:         \"checkpoint_name\": \"blueprint-code-0-3\",\n68:         \"mode\": \"replace\",\n69:         \"patch\": [\n70:           {\n71:             \"new\": \"        path_only = f'pathonly{uuid.uuid4().hex[:12]}'\\n        query_only = f'queryonly{uuid.uuid4().hex[:12]}'\\n        url_a = f'https://{host_token}.atlas-acceptance.example/{path_only}?q={query_only}'\",\n72:             \"old\": \"        url_a = f'https://{host_token}.atlas-acceptance.example/notes/{uuid.uuid4().hex[:10]}'\"\n73:           },\n74:           {\n75:             \"new\": \"        # Tokens occur only in excluded fields of this target, never in allowed ones.\\n        for label, token_value in (('url-path', path_only), ('url-query', query_only), ('category-name', cat_a)):\\n            allowed_text = ' '.join((title_a, host_token + '.atlas-acceptance.example', desc_a)).lower()\\n            recorder.check(f'a07-{label}-isolated-token', token_value.lower() not in allowed_text,\\n                           '负例 token 不在目标记录 title/hostname/description')\\n            for scoped in (False, True):\\n                aid = f'a07-excludes-{label}-' + ('category' if scoped else 'all')\\n                params = {'q': token_value}\\n                if scoped:\\n                    params['category'] = cat_a\\n                results = _search(client, recorder, aid + '-json', params)\\n                recorder.check(aid + '-json-target-absent', id_a not in _record_ids(results),\\n                               'JSON 不因 URL path/query 或分类名而命中目标记录')\\n                html = _html_search(client, recorder, aid + '-html', search_form,\\n                                    cat_a if scoped else '', token_value)\\n                recorder.check(aid + '-html-target-absent', id_a not in _row_ids(html),\\n                               '实际搜索表单的记录行不因排除字段命中；不检查页面回显')\\n        # These positive controls also prove both entry points do not return always-empty.\\n        for label, positive_token in (('title', shared), ('hostname', host_token), ('description', desc_token)):\\n            positive_doc = _html_search(client, recorder, f'a07-html-positive-{label}',\\n                                        search_form, cat_a, positive_token.upper())\\n            recorder.check(f'a07-html-positive-{label}-hit', id_a in _row_ids(positive_doc),\\n                           '允许字段经真实 HTML 搜索表单仍命中同一记录')\\n        doc_empty = _html_search(client, recorder, 'a07-html-empty', search_form, cat_a, unmatched)\",\n76:             \"old\": \"        doc_empty = _html_search(client, recorder, 'a07-html-empty', search_form, cat_a, unmatched)\"\n77:           }\n78:         ],\n79:         \"patch_digest\": \"ba5c0ac00060bbeb1558b13172afec12e1d5a06de6edf3c6a1ac135aece0037b\",\n80:         \"path\": \"acceptance/p0_find_open.py\",\n81:         \"prepared_ref\": \"docs/template-factory/g1-r7-acceptance-alignment-2026-10-20/prepared-programs/acceptance/p0_find_open.py\",\n82:         \"source_attempt\": 1,\n83:         \"source_job_id\": \"job_f3e32b56036b4ec7bea0c00d6a2a8dc4\"\n84:       },\n85:       {\n86:         \"after_sha256\": \"372c75aa2944a10cc5146859dc0bacd0e03111defe7c8aa75ece2d28ec45aff3\",\n87:         \"authorization_clause\": \"R7 §3.0 exact byte-for-byte reuse\",\n88:         \"before_sha256\": \"372c75aa2944a10cc5146859dc0bacd0e03111defe7c8aa75ece2d28ec45aff3\",\n89:         \"checkpoint_digest\": \"7f238639de648816407a16be5044c27fa706dec1d1480c6731a99e369eb99b16\",\n90:         \"checkpoint_name\": \"blueprint-code-0-4\",\n91:         \"mode\": \"reuse\",\n92:         \"patch\": [],\n93:         \"patch_digest\": \"4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945\",\n94:         \"path\": \"acceptance/p0_recovery.py\",\n95:         \"prepared_ref\": \"docs/template-factory/g1-r7-acceptance-alignment-2026-10-20/prepared-programs/acceptance/p0_recovery.py\",\n96:         \"source_attempt\": 1,\n97:         \"source_job_id\": \"job_f3e32b56036b4ec7bea0c00d6a2a8dc4\"\n98:       },\n99:       {\n100:         \"after_sha256\": \"d44e17c87314db18084b3b88bd2c700a75bfe583d108e9b518040fb8378601a3\",\n101:         \"authorization_clause\": \"R7 §3.0 exact byte-for-byte reuse\",\n102:         \"before_sha256\": \"d44e17c87314db18084b3b88bd2c700a75bfe583d108e9b518040fb8378601a3\",\n103:         \"checkpoint_digest\": \"0bc21e0d36d335238ffd5f97a5a2709fcceafc480be1186182083f4f6716e7ea\",\n104:         \"checkpoint_name\": \"blueprint-code-0-5\",\n105:         \"mode\": \"reuse\",\n106:         \"patch\": [],\n107:         \"patch_digest\": \"4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945\",\n108:         \"path\": \"acceptance/p1_maturity.py\",\n109:         \"prepared_ref\": \"docs/template-factory/g1-r7-acceptance-alignment-2026-10-20/prepared-programs/acceptance/p1_maturity.py\",\n110:         \"source_attempt\": 1,\n111:         \"source_job_id\": \"job_f3e32b56036b4ec7bea0c00d6a2a8dc4\"\n112:       },\n113:       {\n114:         \"after_sha256\": \"f1fc18b605a1eea93892d319d09122d91033a48dfd4b913f8f262a4dc8633deb\",\n115:         \"authorization_clause\": \"R7 §3.0 exact byte-for-byte reuse\",\n116:         \"before_sha256\": \"f1fc18b605a1eea93892d319d09122d91033a48dfd4b913f8f262a4dc8633deb\",\n117:         \"checkpoint_digest\": \"cb630836a7b32a2ae7df6b836e4ceb2bfed9cb3b3048e002ef91df979bec6ea2\",\n118:         \"checkpoint_name\": \"blueprint-code-0-6\",\n119:         \"mode\": \"reuse\",\n120:         \"patch\": [],\n121:         \"patch_digest\": \"4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945\",\n122:         \"path\": \"acceptance/requirements.txt\",\n123:         \"prepared_ref\": \"docs/template-factory/g1-r7-acceptance-alignment-2026-10-20/prepared-programs/acceptance/requirements.txt\",\n124:         \"source_attempt\": 1,\n125:         \"source_job_id\": \"job_f3e32b56036b4ec7bea0c00d6a2a8dc4\"\n126:       },\n127:       {\n128:         \"after_sha256\": \"9e73ee6233e5b991a9682bb0bcaa235783bd4c7a6d399d5be38c100face9db6e\",\n129:         \"authorization_clause\": \"R7 §5.4 README factual correction only\",\n130:         \"before_sha256\": \"01cf57941aeed3e0bfa431349b832429f4518addebd00528e8bc1a33ff189459\",\n131:         \"checkpoint_digest\": \"98ec076f0980147323606a89081e18bd32dc85b393fd4ba7e2cf69e4a6bb8f3a\",\n132:         \"checkpoint_name\": \"blueprint-code-0-7\",\n133:         \"mode\": \"replace\",\n134:         \"patch\": [\n135:           {\n136:             \"new\": \"# 生活待购与灵感收藏夹 — 验收运行说明\\n\\n本目录是一套独立、冻结的验收套件，用真实 HTTP 目标验证 python-web 应用。它不包含应用实现，不导入应用代码，也不读取应用自己的测试判定；本文档只是运行说明，不代表任何用例已经执行或通过。**本套件未执行，任何人不得据此声称测试通过。**\\n\\n## 1. 目标适配器\\n\\n| 参数 | 适用范围 | 用途 |\\n| --- | --- | --- |\\n| `--base-url` | A01–A15（全部） | 已部署 python-web 实例的 http/https 根 URL；所有 base_url 行为断言都发往该 origin。 |\\n| `--app-root` | A01、A05、A09、A11 | 只读应用源码根；必须包含 `app/serve.py`，用于启动同一冻结应用的隔离实例。 |\\n| `--data-dir` | A01、A05、A09、A11、A14 | 测试者可变草稿根；重启适配器在其 `instances/` 下创建每实例目录；A14 在此生成导入 HTML。 |\\n\\n### 1.1 `--base-url`\\n\\n- 示例：`http://127.0.0.1:8000`。必须是 http 或 https；不得包含用户名、口令、查询串或片段。\\n- 验收目标声明无认证；套件不会把凭据放入 URL、请求头、日志或 fixtures。`HttpClient` 拒绝 `Authorization`/`Proxy-Authorization`；若目标要求 Basic/Bearer/session 等认证，或健康检查返回 401/403，程序在业务请求前显式失败并报告基础设施未就绪，不支持认证适配器，也不跳过或伪造通过。\\n- 每个请求都绑定到该精确 origin（scheme、hostname、port）；重定向逐跳校验，跨源立即失败。不会放行任意 loopback 主机或端口，也不默认信任所有 localhost 端口。\\n\\n### 1.2 `--app-root`、`--data-dir` 与每实例隔离\\n\\n- `--app-root` 是只读源码，必须存在 `<app_root>/app/serve.py`。套件只读取和启动它，不修改它，也不读取应用的自测判定。\\n- `--data-dir` 只是测试者的草稿根目录，必须可写，且不得等于 `--app-root` 或 `/`。\\n- `launch_app` 在 `<data_dir>/instances/` 下创建 `<uuid>/`，并把该子目录作为应用 `--data-dir`。应用数据库（如 `bookmarks.sqlite3`）位于实例子目录内；宿主 `<data_dir>` 根目录绝不作为应用数据库。\\n- 需要重启的用例复用第一次的实例子目录；日志写到 `<data_dir>/instances/<uuid>/logs/app-*.log`。\\n- A14 在 `<data_dir>` 根写入 `import-<token>.html`，仅作为 `/api/import` 的输入；它不是数据库，也不代表目标响应。\\n\\n### 1.3 重启持久化适配器\\n\\nA01、A05、A09 使用以下真实进程适配器（cwd 为 `app_root`）：\\n\\n`[当前 Python 解释器 (sys.executable), \\\"<app_root>/app/serve.py\\\", \\\"--host\\\", \\\"127.0.0.1\\\", \\\"--port\\\", \\\"<free_port()>\\\", \\\"--data-dir\\\", \\\"<data_dir>/instances/<uuid>\\\"]`\\n\\n- 启动时移除代理环境变量，stdout/stderr 写入实例日志；轮询 `GET /api/health`，仅当返回 200 且 JSON 对象时视为就绪（默认 30 秒）。\\n- 对隔离实例执行真实创建/移动/删除等动作，然后 `stop_app`（SIGTERM，超时后 SIGKILL），再以相同实例子目录启动同一冻结应用，读回并断言行为。\\n- 该重启证据只证明从 `app_root` 启动的隔离实例可持久化，不证明 `--base-url` 指向的已部署实例可重启。若外部目标只读且不可重启，重启部分必须显式报告未验证或失败，不能以健康检查或新进程替代。\\n\\n## 2. 运行时要求与依赖\\n\\n- 交付 profile：`python-web`。\\n- Python 3.12；仅使用标准库（`http.server`、... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n137:             \"old\": \"# 生活待购与灵感收藏夹 — 验收运行说明\\n\\n本目录是一套独立、冻结的验收套件，用真实 HTTP 目标验证 python-web 应用。它不包含应用实现，不导入应用代码，也不读取应用自己的测试判定；本文档只是运行说明，不代表任何用例已经执行或通过。**本套件未执行，任何人不得据此声称测试通过。**\\n\\n## 1. 目标适配器\\n\\n| 参数 | 适用范围 | 用途 |\\n| --- | --- | --- |\\n| `--base-url` | A01–A15（全部） | 已部署 python-web 实例的 http/https 根 URL；所有 base_url 行为断言都发往该 origin。 |\\n| `--app-root` | A01、A05、A09 | 只读应用源码根；必须包含 `app/serve.py`，用于启动同一冻结应用的隔离实例。 |\\n| `--data-dir` | A01、A05、A09、A14 | 测试者可变草稿根；重启适配器在其 `instances/` 下创建每实例目录；A14 在此生成导入 HTML。 |\\n\\n### 1.1 `--base-url`\\n\\n- 示例：`http://127.0.0.1:8000`。必须是 http 或 https；不得包含用户名、口令、查询串或片段。\\n- 验收目标声明无认证；套件不会把凭据放入 URL、请求头、日志或 fixtures。`HttpClient` 拒绝 `Authorization`/`Proxy-Authorization`；若目标要求 Basic/Bearer/session 等认证，或健康检查返回 401/403，程序在业务请求前显式失败并报告基础设施未就绪，不支持认证适配器，也不跳过或伪造通过。\\n- 每个请求都绑定到该精确 origin（scheme、hostname、port）；重定向逐跳校验，跨源立即失败。不会放行任意 loopback 主机或端口，也不默认信任所有 localhost 端口。\\n\\n### 1.2 `--app-root`、`--data-dir` 与每实例隔离\\n\\n- `--app-root` 是只读源码，必须存在 `<app_root>/app/serve.py`。套件只读取和启动它，不修改它，也不读取应用的自测判定。\\n- `--data-dir` 只是测试者的草稿根目录，必须可写，且不得等于 `--app-root` 或 `/`。\\n- `launch_app` 在 `<data_dir>/instances/` 下创建 `<uuid>/`，并把该子目录作为应用 `--data-dir`。应用数据库（如 `bookmarks.sqlite3`）位于实例子目录内